rd": " à", "start": 19.74, "end": 19.82}, {"word": " heure", "start": 19.82, "end": 19.98}, {"word": " fixe,", "start": 19.98, "end": 20.5}, {"word": " pas", "start": 20.5, "end": 20.84}, {"word": " au", "start": 20.84, "end": 20.94}, {"word": " réveil,", "start": 20.94, "end": 21.42}, {"word": " sinon", "start": 21.44, "end": 21.86}, {"word": " tu", "start": 21.86, "end": 22.0}, {"word": " gères", "start": 22.0, "end": 22.18}, {"word": " les", "start": 22.18, "end": 22.3}, {"word": " urgences", "start": 22.3, "end": 23.16}, {"word": " des", "start": 23.16, "end": 23.28}, {"word": " autres.", "start": 23.28, "end": 23.46}]}, {"start": 24.44, "end": 27.14, "text": " Franchement, mise bout à bout, ça peut te rendre deux heures par jour.", "words": [{"word": " Franchement,", "start": 24.44, "end": 24.88}, {"word": " mise", "start": 24.92, "end": 25.24}, {"word": " bout", "start": 25.24, "end": 25.42}, {"word": " à", "start": 25.42, "end": 25.56}, {"word": " bout,", "start": 25.56, "end": 25.68}, {"word": " ça", "start": 25.74, "end": 25.98}, {"word": " peut", "start": 25.98, "end": 26.16}, {"word": " te", "start": 26.16, "end": 26.26}, {"word": " rendre", "start": 26.26, "end": 26.44}, {"word": " deux", "start": 26.44, "end": 26.64}, {"word": " heures", "start": 26.64, "end": 26.82}, {"word": " par", "start": 26.82, "end": 26.94}, {"word": " jour.", "start": 26.94, "end": 27.14}]}], "text": " Et si tes matins te volaient deux heures par jour ?  Trois habitudes pour les récupérer.  Un pas de téléphone la première heure,  parce que juste deux minutes sur une appli, ça finit souvent en une demi-heure.  Deux, tu choisis ta tâche la plus importante la veille,  comme ça au réveil tu attaques direct.  Trois, tes mails et tes messages.  C'est à heure fixe, pas au réveil, sinon tu gères les urgences des autres.  Franchement, mise bout à bout, ça peut te rendre deux heures par jour."}